<!-- Shown on gesture rows whose target app is missing (item_gesture.xml).

     Unlike the other ic_* drawables this one is NOT tinted with ?attr/colorControlNormal —
     "this mapping is broken" should stay amber rather than take the normal icon colour. The
     tint routes through @color/warning so light mode gets a darkened amber; full-strength
     #FFC107 is close to illegible against a light ground. -->
